            "review_title": "Review at Thuy Duong Halong Pub Kitchen & Beer",
            "review_text": "Gina\n4 contributions\n0\nGreat foods and drinks ,friendly service\nMar 2024 • Family\nWe were this pub in march 2024.went in for dinner and drinks the staff are very helpful ( specical the manager )he very friendly and nice guy ,lovely surrounding , the foods and cocktails are wonderful .we ended up have 3 evening meals here and they were extremly good would defintely add this to your list of lovely places to eat in halong .we also asked the manager about tour around and it was great ,highly recommend.\nRead more\nWritten May 14, 2024",
